      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "The quoting experience was very professional and I did not feel pressured to go with them. Some of the other installers I found sign you up to their distribution email list and spam your inbox. This does not occur with Tilstons.The installation was very professional. Our 12.67Kw system was installed over 2 days. The installers were very tidy and cleaned up at the end of each day.At the end of the installation the team set up my connection to the grid and also my phone to monitor the data from the inverter.Overall it was a great experience and will definitely reach out to them in the future for a battery installation.",
